   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## In progress (not in these nodes yet)\nTested as scripts on a rifle grip take, being moved into Track FP Hands:\n- prop placed by point tracking (sub-pixel) instead of its mask\n- grasp step: each finger wraps, presses or stays free; depth adjusted so the handle sits inside the hand\n- forearm roll (pronation / supination) so the wrist doesn't wring\n- smooth -> re-grasp -> smooth, so the grip holds without jitter"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
